OL,3,AUK and EU set to agree youth mobility
OL,4,Ascheme as Burnham due in Brussels for
OL,5,Asummit
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham will be in Brussels today
OL,8,Ffor a UK-EU summit, as he looks to
OL,9,Freshape Britain's relationship with the
OL,10,Fbloc
OL,12,FA youth mobility scheme is due to be
OL,13,Fagreed - the BBC understands it would
OL,14,Fallow 100,000 young people from the EU
OL,15,Fto travel, work and study in the UK per
OL,16,Fyear. The same number of young Britons
OL,17,Fwould be allowed into Europe
OL,19,FDowning Street has not commented on the
OL,20,Fdetails, with new deals on food and
OL,21,Ftrade also on the table
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
